WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.330
Dear John,
亲爱的约翰：

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.890
I’m writing to tell you about a short play I’m planning.
我写信是想告诉你，我正在筹划一部短剧。

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:19.540
Based on the classic Chinese novel Journey to the West, it tells how the Monkey King and his companions overcome all kinds of difficulties on their journey to obtain the Buddhist scriptures.
这部短剧根据中国古典小说《西游记》改编，讲述孙悟空和他的同伴们如何在取经路上克服各种各样的困难。

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:26.210
The play will last about 20 minutes and be performed in English at our college art festival next month.
这部短剧时长约20分钟，将于下个月在我们学院的艺术节上用英语演出。

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:37.040
Knowing that you love Chinese culture and have acting experience, I sincerely invite you to join us and play the role of Zhu Bajie, a funny but kind-hearted character.
我知道你热爱中国文化，也有表演经验，因此诚挚地邀请你加入我们，扮演猪八戒——一个滑稽却心地善良的角色。

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.780
Rehearsals will be held every Saturday afternoon.
排练将在每周六下午进行。

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.770
Please let me know if you are interested.
请告诉我你是否感兴趣。

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.570
Best wishes, Li Ming
祝好！李明
